function [fitresult, gof] = T2Curve(times, signals)
%CREATEFIT(TIMES,SIGNALS)
%  Create a fit.
%
%  Data for 'T2' fit:
%      X Input: times
%      Y Output: signals
%  Output:
%      fitresult : a fit object representing the fit.
%      gof : structure with goodness-of fit info.
